---
kind: lore
id: south.catches
title: Southshore catch reactions
---

// Reactions to catches that belong to the south. All `also`: the spine's
// first-catch call (spine.firstCatch) and any other area's winner stay the
// winner; these play after it, or alone.

<beat id="lunafae" on="caught" target="mon.lunafae" title="A Lunafae" also>
  @narrator{code="0010"}: The Lunafae hums in its capsule, a sad, high, wind-chime note. Somewhere in Moonstone Cave, the others hum back.
</beat>

<beat id="domefossil" on="caught" target="mon.domefossil" title="A living Domefossil" also>
  @pebbletonKell{code="0010" vo}: Remember: it has never seen a sky before. It will want to look at it for a very long time. Let it.
</beat>

<beat id="spiralfossil" on="caught" target="mon.spiralfossil" title="A living Spiralfossil" also>
  @pebbletonKell{code="0010" vo}: Spiralfossils eat seaweed and rock salt and, if you let them, sandwiches. Don't let them.
</beat>

<beat id="wingfossil" on="caught" target="mon.wingfossil" title="A living Wingfossil" also>
  @narrator{code="0010"}: The Wingfossil unfolds its stone wings in the museum's back room, knocks over three display stands, and looks enormously pleased with itself.
</beat>

<beat id="goldfinn" on="caught" target="mon.goldfinn" title="A Goldfinn" also when="quest.southOldSaltFirst.state == 'active'">
  @narrator{code="0010"}: A Goldfinn, flapping. Old Salt Morrow asked for exactly this. He's on the end of the Tidewell pier, not moving.
</beat>

<beat id="seahorsling" on="caught" target="mon.seahorsling" title="A Seahorsling" also when="quest.southDerby.state == 'active'">
  <match subject="clock.weekday">
    <when is="6">
      @narrator{code="0010"}: A Seahorsling! On derby day! The whole pier turns round to look.
    </when>
    <otherwise>
      @narrator{code="0020"}: A Seahorsling. Pim's derby is on Sunday; this one won't count, but the next one might.
    </otherwise>
  </match>
</beat>
